    {
      "id": "4f912679-f522-4ca5-94da-cce3c143c986",
      "title": "Chegando ao caixa",
      "description": "<p>A peça já foi provada e escolhida. Aqui, o foco é ouvir como a decisão aparece e como a compra pode ganhar um pedido prático logo em seguida.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Entonces, te lo llevas?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Então, você vai levar?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/4b553211c9eb42e6b84e2642167c9c23_l04b01-linea-01.mp3?Expires=1794099652&Signature=CLt97eWwthcXxpZT6k6tkhhAee6LLDqXxzR7Xi2lerMUgtltAZ29QAvcX9qldItxNJsM3RTdG4D-6NpjO5d4BPkz89uQNo96an-qIT-nVt4rEjg98DC-vxSrzB8eA2sAX1OiTYSrOojakTUgGrEa~8Q572HWAVFWDMfq4Uk1pN5ZHe--ldc5i4TBWgKU1jicW36DA4w~~Qi2mo2oPHk9IS4mUpqPtnX1S-jEfm3WyzWH-opDVHc0ccpmn8ZDBO~-l~a6eGrIxVOlGkKAeMCNj-VgzDZYyEqCJ6jW8eWWtnEoM9g8CAmm3KihBrHUTTDVbjR5aJAiuUmlfIbIeQGEcA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sí, me lo llevo.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Sim, vou levar.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/fb20613ed72b466f9bc9b4e465d61e85_l04b01-linea-02.mp3?Expires=1794099652&Signature=MkfFzsw9C5-5B~~XZz-BaUND3WLCCin74TIoCBhByVAS3GlXWJ1JAUSJiXwjpxHUx4Swb-gNnK41PMior2zCQZq-l34vvlG-RrGjLKZUSgXC-Zn-O8xkAdlEug~89zMe7O00KHAZ5~dsxO6EH88gPVMmTzJa6R3THANktXLBWIq5VdR39PobV~qvopOs3txGklz5fwf6BYCOfteUIPSewDxhW~EGy5-7DdWNzDXLClzBRDYyaqWntCVa8HVAnAHFXQ6x-9phP2IqFzBdH7QrCgYdqavGNwn~4oqP3wuNtFRNT2rdyUqkx3a-QhYmO0sVJLYORC4gFkKcMq7JNc7RAQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Me lo puede envolver para regalo?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Pode embrulhar para presente?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a2b7ac607da54a1393a584fc3a0c7218_l04b01-linea-03.mp3?Expires=1794099652&Signature=zf6gyKdbfuUeOjyyv013gJ7FEiDD~hd0q9f7dndF1tjgRzD0fCeDoi9s9aBgokePt7vUOMvYk4pVA5CQJSaJmlGMgmGaQx9GaB9q05V260H0K~nFgwOm3edN0rgWQepi2xmjwoJPSyP2FvngDrW5H3qm0zjnz94PPKBMbkGYAmSWrXBrnLVB0vi~CnMybAEtWueasITiu~dh-NjgmkS6E7tTf3OaetoHtaWBoziYMzIp0kNaanbFJz9sR5LnSNq-XLDi2gOf6~a3EiKv4xdp9DNyVVNsO~tLAba66VmYdrp7gfONWCayztq0JDj8VVglBnSDrQ9xfZEoR-3EX31JIQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
