    {
      "id": "b50c4666-5433-4d77-a18f-7add0e4e3f6f",
      "title": "Olhe a cena, escute a frase e ligue cada resposta ao momento em que você fecha ou adia a compra.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "520cb432-1269-4a1f-9ea2-43171beacccc",
          "textContent": "<p>Quando a decisão está tomada, a fala fecha a compra com poucas palavras.</p><p><strong>Me lo llevo.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Vou levar.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/ab46222d30be43dbbfca6af1c85be5a2_l04b02-me-lo-llevo.png?Expires=1794099652&Signature=Vk~09sPI~tnoH18JZnCJ7~dG5-wl8k1Rtwrob0Oc1DyeKP4u~-2BNKli0s47oSc6g99ofTED2nn53QTK0gvxvHl0FRAGALUD3uKD9Z5oRv~Y3Z3f7lZfnxADEnpRmlSom6VHs2mrtuZ~tXtiXgCoLR1~UwySaiFYODKEURPRtDyTfnakJH6ckF8I73ckv7f9-PoS9c39G0TYH~VKRTYizUp0SKHKmmIYVuFzwUIw2GsZelnJJUE8vuLj3ivCGeyFf7bzFk2kTNoG2B1IURsATSYE7TltJ7v-89XEREC5G~UD50r~8cSocZo2ohz5hBarLSDG5OJP3jZrN9Fpd7lNqg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a580e30463904297966340180e2c7094_l04b02-me-lo-llevo.mp3?Expires=1794099652&Signature=pp2TUB3tmIVSkN1nILERH2XyvdgjodcsSA99id0J8RakOtIxdaOGtclRIvHqJK1JWMbV1XwDwNvlfk5jp2wKC1DxfeZa3D4h~-hbrZ909gVEmqJaQqSB3Gjb5sd9ku7iIYpdTHES2t-APLxZ0rXC7rm77d~W2rs3vez7g41Q5LP2OFgTO~hcu1ukDhmT3CGVIJmTN4m0rKCEK9u8IL~-C1EOS0nm4Az4Ba~J-W1mrWZN35ahRwpo6MMNGMl-Jb-Ja3Ia8xcn6AxqR0pF0Hfta7XcPe738p1ayClROpCEWyafHNB3ZS1xux5cI9ts2~g58C~wq54kuY6ZW2LQwb2dBw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "f3c0db09-a9d4-4ea6-b8cb-474e77e1d47e",
          "textContent": "<p>Se você ainda quer tempo, a fala segura a decisao sem parecer brusca.</p><p><strong>Me lo pienso.</strong></p><p>Em portugues: <strong>Ainda vou pensar.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/cd05cfbc26dc480dbf1c826955d1984b_l04b02-me-lo-pienso.png?Expires=1794099652&Signature=2PgzoEuD3r2jbGFeAGP1gXvOHyeLiQIFlbplYB5M4UP4MsubLGCCQkF2TJjbS-VlXWoembF9Oqm0iXB~sAW0w2o-9t~HwXmsencwfv2ms-KrS7xvHNRW5gfoS~eUzFcgvJT20D0BKFswUpf8m36QmgNIcJHVkKbNGZah~AgIhdYkhyjjB77-qDgXafTk2hRRPn1TYK8PvSqsJMHKo9nlxXDCY1JZkgWHwMxid9ebPK2UNx0QXT~MSkEoRAu~yTrYb1oq3LDTQCpRF7adqaAV5NVKIw4DFhgUv4jB8KrWzCZI-7w4uiJoGQ~BP3eKbyLzIMDyV4IvchK1OagyIh4NpA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/0759509aeff14dae98c38300997d6c3d_l04b02-me-lo-pienso.mp3?Expires=1794099652&Signature=lIv88Ur4ziRr4~0Di8Mo22WtczzkdkfG2teLrQ9LGeEEmhSsDF-VMm04lmh84~ROPCm~DcNxmlqm8Ie6l1x~wtKJ39AMdjb6BOQW0yNFKxmoSruQ4XRdVtNu-cdp9woR6YisaGCzEvzgTuF29O0AQJyEKf9shb01vwlh~VsblIC6~hK3wJhr3~9XEUk5Pv2S6LF8xc6OLmpm~KLKOYY7fwrWMh6Usvp5UyXEPz6ABsMOZd2sLdFJMWynk4-Z2ZeZUlnA8jOasjE77ydPRSymXroLkD7k64qYynKGik9idligFkKlW97Va-LKMrBcpVZu1z34iNyOIWtnNi1gQIO12w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "c5974d9b-4045-4f55-88bc-6582b3cb6a4f",
          "textContent": "<p>As duas frases aparecem no mesmo ponto da conversa: depois de ver como a peça ficou.</p><p><strong>Me lo llevo.</strong> fecha a compra agora. <strong>Me lo pienso.</strong> deixa a decisao para depois.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d897f2f5-aa81-4e6b-bfee-201f983d9f7b",
      "title": "Passe pelos passos e observe como o espanhol muda quando o foco vai para o caixa, para o presente ou para o depois da compra.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "0e51b46f-4e3e-47bd-b29f-c7c11ef79d89",
          "textContent": "<p>Se a decisão já saiu, o próximo passo costuma ser o caixa.</p><p><strong>Quiero pagar.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Quero pagar.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        },
        {
          "id": "bed5ae21-65cd-4818-8bd2-751aa6f3fb8b",
          "textContent": "<p>Se a compra não vai direto para você, entra o pedido de presente.</p><p><strong>¿Me lo puede envolver para regalo?</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Pode embrulhar para presente?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        },
        {
          "id": "e7de0189-fa50-4fb7-8808-d161cf036c62",
          "textContent": "<p>Se você pensa no depois da compra, a loja pode falar de <strong>ticket</strong>, <strong>cambio</strong> ou <strong>devolución</strong>.</p><p>A pergunta mais prática aqui é <strong>¿Se puede cambiar?</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Dá para trocar?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "917cc1b1-9092-44ff-b907-85dcc6046444",
      "title": "Fechando a compra e perguntando pelo depois",
      "description": "<p>Agora as peças aparecem juntas: decisão, pagamento, ticket e pergunta de troca. O foco continua curto para manter a aula leve.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sí, me lo llevo. Quiero pagar con tarjeta.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Sim, vou levar. Quero pagar com cartão.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/40eeb0e7ada348ba947421c73980f274_l04b04-linea-01.mp3?Expires=1794099652&Signature=o1Oltvs4Ctcx2ZTYlzTB2T-bJkNpaW~wz1EHjzSSqZO6DJYfMA2t2N3Zj0s3bvv7lZiI8kpgccv5n6Fx5fPz1B-~pe1DyvJw-fYe1SnZK2fAom0hQuf94h-UWCwFwdPqo3zcV6NDYY3Ktep95I6ZIVE9cWUf~lXd25fm8Lv5XaYgwjJl75A7BaI7sWysI9yhuMVX9hbtIET6-iHhHlaeOin8pIcbiNOVDQYZe6MT5U5NC-XZGV9kRSwsaTf-NLMibNzGraDnWAY2rcgIAVkxWk2R1ZQt290LVhWM3-nAjblXnWszP-UHQBxY0Atj5VyiPrMUkymWM5AEc8gF3llqEA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Perfecto. Le dejo el ticket dentro.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Perfeito. Vou deixar o ticket dentro.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/4ad0eab8af1d4c0f965e2add8be3505f_l04b04-linea-02.mp3?Expires=1794099652&Signature=HyRjqun5lsaK9G0wrkpFImev4wvZIQtRp-S53Hti0ebrLf0K5cNhPv3Ustrxm0OaYrSs7X6RfeUT~~rzKR~tw91WtTnp4N~E-IhRS3y9AYCs2eRwlHhfEJCC1jT-Rq~5EsnvT7NVe4mKyISCF2BNBC7nsTeAuHSNS7LxqSidR1~ovJ4lrXskIdWy6E1SAbXrRmI9rRjB7QsTh7VoNzETSg7l~Gl6FZpvHTQseaodPLBFh-glB-UCYpA1WKiHOZNu2FUTwpztQoWtbeul9ZLz4R1k25Loxv3BbrLINsvotPKLilpZWhnErnjRXyT6EF2L84lMQ0Cs5BWLTrjouOhtkg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Gracias. ¿Y si no le queda bien, se puede cambiar?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Obrigada. E se não servir bem, dá para trocar?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/5e1110be581a45c486f5d85a7e1d785f_l04b04-linea-03.mp3?Expires=1794099652&Signature=ZNc5UVWHEFD0r3-77LXv~ikr0KD47XC5-qvouas~OMjSseZCLxADLh0LHr9CL1snjoa-FE9CXrcoJEnqHn0~du8JSb7Dbrr8VUuK3cQaMphuH1a9iPXXBjjZiWQp6pL2hWrq81uQHzRXtGeIBk~8BHJvFU0O1Xxv68XQl43AY~TuljToyabYpXXKnBkOReddvUNMTZHGYoW7bbrk6yIdTJ8M2HNJ9KXWdiOxSMEh6ZjYkfnsTo2e-SLRF8fJ5AEuxxVGQ9UjfG79ML0z7IQwmkJP02HNRPXlJihRys7yfR5FexDYjp-z1X9i-2e1HtEqcK~9D3OHCiQuRVuTw0~qDg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sí, con el ticket y en buen estado.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Sim, com o ticket e em bom estado.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b8f3d2c8b5844b6c97c2c958ad0434ac_l04b04-linea-04.mp3?Expires=1794099652&Signature=jfYAXYOipBway3AHyVNr4CVEKIV7hTe-r3Epfiaj7mdSOtg2dBtmdyC3n4~GMCRp9NjbElRKDlcINbgm31A2d6XCidbuldcobeRYgt8UijQ9TusYZEZYJl75yaK7oqOHZbVdHFbqgel9FdwWeygfC-iWIDCZg~wnGTwclF-X4ERJUdz5aJVluz5dUNNELiAga8cMXShGv2Flq-wBC3eOzqh7CNiT9gUdMrUleVHk428AJVbjiKoYBPYdWcpij8TTbjGkVXHl6~xG1hcN2WRuytKW9dA1Sucqi~A1rJZOx-TM9dSg9vACbVhJLOT8NiSdVFYltS6hlTUUfj33AiuMvw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
